            <p class="Division"><a name="13.19.002"></a>Division 13-19-002<br />Irrigation Plans</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1319002.html#13.19.002.0001">13-19-002-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Irrigation Plans</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.19.002.0001"><a name="13.19.002.0001">13-19-002-0001</a> Irrigation Plans</h3>
            <p class="P0">Minimum plan requirements include a schematic utility connection detail, irrigation legend, piping diagrams, pipe diameter and design calculations. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

